PROJECT ATTRIBUTION

NovaMusicStream is a derivative and maintained version of the original
FallenMusic project created by AnonymousX1025. The project has been adapted,
stabilized, and extended for the NovaMusicStream repository by DevNova-ID /
DreamToRealityCreative.

Original project:
  FallenMusic — AnonymousX1025

Current project:
  NovaMusicStream — DevNova-ID / DreamToRealityCreative
  https://github.com/devnovaa-id/NovaMusicStream

MAJOR MAINTENANCE AND IMPROVEMENTS

  - Pyrogram, Telethon, and Py-TgCalls integration
  - Audio and video voice-chat streaming
  - Broadcast-channel playback support
  - Queue and playback-control improvements
  - Thumbnail and media-download improvements
  - Auto-invite and assistant-account handling
  - Error handling, compatibility, and runtime stabilization
  - Docker, Procfile, and deployment documentation

THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE

NovaMusicStream uses third-party libraries and services. Each dependency
remains subject to its own license and terms. Important project dependencies
include Pyrogram, Telethon, Py-TgCalls, yt-dlp, FFmpeg, and YouTube-related
services. Their licenses are not replaced by this file.

